.agent-settings
  .settings-heading
    div
      h3 AI Tools
      p.settings-muted 管理你的 AI 连接，选择一个连接开始配置。
    button.btn.btn-primary.settings-add(type='button', (click)='addProfile()') + 添加 API 连接
  .settings-default
    .settings-default-label
      label(for='agent-default-profile') 默认连接
      span.settings-muted 新面板使用此连接
    select#agent-default-profile.form-control([(ngModel)]='settings.defaultProfileId', (ngModelChange)='save()')
      option(value='') Codex（本机登录）
      option(*ngFor='let profile of profiles; trackBy: trackProfile', [value]='profile.id') {{profile.name || '未命名连接'}} · {{providerNames[profile.provider]}}
  p.settings-notice(role='status', *ngIf='notice') {{notice}}
  .settings-workspace
    nav.connection-nav(aria-label='AI 连接列表')
      .connection-nav-heading
        strong 连接
        span.settings-count {{profiles.length + 1}}
      .connection-list
        button.connection-item(type='button', *ngFor='let profile of profiles; trackBy: trackProfile', (click)='selectProfile(profile.id)', [class.connection-selected]='!memoryOpen && selectedProfileId === profile.id', [attr.aria-pressed]='!memoryOpen && selectedProfileId === profile.id', [attr.data-provider]='profile.provider', aria-controls='agent-connection-editor')
          span.provider-mark(aria-hidden='true') {{providerNames[profile.provider].slice(0, 1)}}
          span.connection-info
            span.connection-name-row
              span.connection-name {{profile.name || '未命名连接'}}
              span.default-badge(*ngIf='settings.defaultProfileId === profile.id') 默认
            span.connection-provider {{providerNames[profile.provider]}}
            span.connection-model([title]='profile.model') {{profile.model || '未设置模型'}}
        button.connection-item.connection-local(type='button', (click)='selectProfile("")', [class.connection-selected]='!memoryOpen && !selectedProfile', [attr.aria-pressed]='!memoryOpen && !selectedProfile', data-provider='codex', aria-controls='agent-connection-editor')
          span.provider-mark(aria-hidden='true') C
          span.connection-info
            span.connection-name-row
              span.connection-name Codex
              span.default-badge(*ngIf='!settings.defaultProfileId') 默认
            span.connection-provider 本机引擎
            span.connection-model 本机登录 · CLI
      button.connection-item.connection-memory(type='button', (click)='openMemory()', [class.connection-selected]='memoryOpen', [attr.aria-pressed]='memoryOpen', data-provider='memory', aria-controls='agent-connection-editor')
        span.provider-mark(aria-hidden='true') M
        span.connection-info
          span.connection-name 任务流程与偏好
          span.connection-provider 归档 · 复用 · 操作习惯
      p.connection-nav-hint.settings-muted 点击连接切换配置
    section#agent-connection-editor.settings-editor([attr.data-provider]='memoryOpen ? "memory" : selectedProfile?.provider || "codex"', aria-label='当前连接配置')
      ng-container(*ngIf='memoryOpen; else connectionEditor')
        .editor-heading
          span.provider-mark(aria-hidden='true') M
          .editor-identity
            .editor-eyebrow 本地记忆
            h4 任务流程与偏好
            .editor-model.settings-muted 少些重复探索，多些经验复用
          button.btn.btn-outline-secondary.editor-default(type='button', (click)='refreshMemory()', [disabled]='memoryLoading') 刷新
        .editor-body.memory-manager
          label.memory-enable
            input(type='checkbox', [ngModel]='settings.taskMemoryEnabled !== false', (ngModelChange)='setTaskMemory($event)')
            span 启用流程归档与自动匹配
          p.settings-muted 完成并核对终端任务后自动归档；发送新任务时，在相同工作目录中匹配一份流程。仅提供参考，不直接重放命令，也不额外调用模型。
          p.settings-notice(role='status', aria-live='polite', *ngIf='memoryNotice') {{memoryNotice}}
          p.settings-muted(*ngIf='memoryLoading') 正在读取本地流程库…
          section.settings-section(aria-labelledby='memory-workflows-heading')
            h5#memory-workflows-heading.section-heading
              span.section-dot(aria-hidden='true')
              | 任务流程 · {{memoryWorkflows.length}}
            p.memory-empty.settings-muted(*ngIf='!memoryLoading && !memoryWorkflows.length') 还没有归档流程。让 Agent 完成一次终端任务并检查结果，确认目标完成后，流程会出现在这里。失败或未核对的任务不会归档。
            .memory-workflow(*ngFor='let workflow of memoryWorkflows')
              .memory-row
                .memory-row-info
                  strong {{workflow.title}}
                  small.settings-muted {{workflow.cwd}}
                  small.settings-muted {{workflow.enabled ? '已启用' : '已停用'}} · 完成 {{workflow.successes}} 次 · 引用 {{workflow.uses}} 次{{workflow.edited ? ' · 已手动编辑' : ''}}
                button.btn.btn-outline-secondary(type='button', (click)='editWorkflow(workflow)', [disabled]='memorySaving') 编辑
                button.btn.btn-link.text-danger(type='button', (click)='removeWorkflow(workflow)', [disabled]='memorySaving') 删除
              .memory-workflow-editor(*ngIf='workflowDraftId === workflow.id')
                .settings-fields
                  .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                    label(for='memory-workflow-title') 流程名称
                    input#memory-workflow-title.form-control([(ngModel)]='workflowTitle')
                  .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                    label(for='memory-workflow-objective') 匹配任务
                    input#memory-workflow-objective.form-control([(ngModel)]='workflowObjective')
                    small.settings-muted 填写典型任务描述，用于匹配下次的类似请求。流程仅在上方工作目录中使用。
                  .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                    label(for='memory-workflow-instructions') 流程步骤
                    textarea#memory-workflow-instructions.form-control(rows='8', [(ngModel)]='workflowInstructions')
                    small.settings-muted 可整理操作顺序、检查点和需要替换的参数。手动编辑后，自动归档不会覆盖这些步骤。
                label.memory-enable
                  input(type='checkbox', [(ngModel)]='workflowEnabled')
                  span 自动匹配此流程
                .memory-row
                  button.btn.btn-primary(type='button', (click)='saveWorkflow()', [disabled]='memorySaving || !workflowTitle.trim() || !workflowObjective.trim() || !workflowInstructions.trim()') 保存流程
                  button.btn.btn-link(type='button', (click)='workflowDraftId = ""', [disabled]='memorySaving') 收起
          section.settings-section(aria-labelledby='memory-preferences-heading')
            h5#memory-preferences-heading.section-heading
              span.section-dot(aria-hidden='true')
              | 操作偏好 · {{memoryPreferences.length}}
            p.settings-muted 只记录你明确保存的偏好，例如“此项目使用 pnpm”“先运行检查再构建”。也可在对话中输入 /remember 偏好，保存到当前工作目录。
            .memory-preference(*ngFor='let preference of memoryPreferences')
              .memory-row
                .memory-row-info
                  strong {{preference.text}}
                  small.settings-muted {{preference.cwd || '全局 · 所有工作目录'}}
                button.btn.btn-link(type='button', (click)='editPreference(preference)', [disabled]='memorySaving') 编辑
                button.btn.btn-link.text-danger(type='button', (click)='removePreference(preference)', [disabled]='memorySaving') 删除
            .settings-fields
              .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                label(for='memory-preference-text') {{preferenceDraftId ? '编辑偏好' : '添加偏好'}}
                textarea#memory-preference-text.form-control(rows='2', [(ngModel)]='preferenceDraft', placeholder='例如：部署前先检查当前分支和目标主机')
              .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                label(for='memory-preference-scope') 适用范围
                select#memory-preference-scope.form-control([(ngModel)]='preferenceScope')
                  option(value='global') 全局
                  option(value='workspace') 指定工作目录
              .settings-field.settings-field-wide(*ngIf='preferenceScope === "workspace"')
                label(for='memory-preference-cwd') 完整工作目录
                input#memory-preference-cwd.form-control([(ngModel)]='preferenceCwd', placeholder='与侧栏显示的工作目录一致')
            .memory-row.memory-preference-save
              button.btn.btn-outline-primary(type='button', (click)='savePreference()', [disabled]='memorySaving || !preferenceDraft.trim()') {{preferenceDraftId ? '保存偏好' : '添加偏好'}}
              button.btn.btn-link(type='button', *ngIf='preferenceDraftId', (click)='preferenceDraftId = ""; preferenceDraft = ""', [disabled]='memorySaving') 取消编辑
      ng-template(#connectionEditor)
        ng-container(*ngIf='selectedProfile as profile; else codexSettings')
          .editor-heading
            span.provider-mark(aria-hidden='true') {{providerNames[profile.provider].slice(0, 1)}}
            .editor-identity
              .editor-eyebrow 当前配置 · {{providerNames[profile.provider]}}
              h4 {{profile.name || '未命名连接'}}
              .editor-model.settings-muted {{profile.model || '尚未选择模型'}}
            span.default-badge(*ngIf='settings.defaultProfileId === profile.id') 默认连接
            button.btn.btn-outline-secondary.editor-default(type='button', *ngIf='settings.defaultProfileId !== profile.id', (click)='setDefault(profile.id)') 设为默认
          //- A keyed view resets scroll and field focus when switching connections.
          .editor-body(*ngFor='let current of [profile]; trackBy: trackProfile')
            section.settings-section(aria-labelledby='api-basic-heading')
              h5#api-basic-heading.section-heading
                span.section-dot(aria-hidden='true')
                | 连接设置
              .settings-fields
                .settings-field
                  label([attr.for]='"api-name-" + profile.id') 连接名称
                  input.form-control([id]='"api-name-" + profile.id', [(ngModel)]='profile.name', (ngModelChange)='save()', placeholder='为这个连接取个名字')
                .settings-field
                  label([attr.for]='"api-provider-" + profile.id') 供应商
                  select.form-control([id]='"api-provider-" + profile.id', [ngModel]='profile.provider', (ngModelChange)='changeProvider(profile, $event)')
                    option(value='openai') OpenAI API
                    option(value='deepseek') DeepSeek
                    option(value='glm') GLM（智谱）
                    option(value='claude') Claude（Anthropic）
                .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                  label([attr.for]='"api-url-" + profile.id') Base URL
                  input.form-control([id]='"api-url-" + profile.id', [(ngModel)]='profile.baseUrl', (ngModelChange)='modelConnectionChanged(profile)', [attr.aria-describedby]='"api-url-hint-" + profile.id', spellcheck='false')
                  small.settings-muted([id]='"api-url-hint-" + profile.id') 填写基础地址，不含 /responses、/messages 或 /chat/completions。支持代理地址；GLM 按套餐选择端点。
                .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                  label([attr.for]='"api-model-" + profile.id') 模型 ID
                  .settings-input-action
                    input.form-control([id]='"api-model-" + profile.id', [(ngModel)]='profile.model', (ngModelChange)='save()', (focus)='fetchModels(profile)', [attr.list]='"api-models-" + profile.id', placeholder='选择或输入模型 ID', [attr.aria-describedby]='"api-model-hint-" + profile.id')
                    button.btn.btn-outline-secondary(type='button', (click)='fetchModels(profile, true)', [disabled]='modelLists[profile.id]?.running') {{modelLists[profile.id]?.running ? '获取中…' : '获取模型'}}
                  datalist([id]='"api-models-" + profile.id')
                    option(*ngFor='let model of modelLists[profile.id]?.models', [value]='model.model') {{model.displayName}}
                  small.settings-muted([id]='"api-model-hint-" + profile.id') 聚焦时自动获取模型列表，也可手动输入完整模型 ID。
                  p.field-notice(role='status', aria-live='polite', *ngIf='modelLists[profile.id]') {{modelLists[profile.id].notice}}
            section.settings-section(aria-labelledby='api-auth-heading')
              h5#api-auth-heading.section-heading
                span.section-dot(aria-hidden='true')
                | 身份验证
              .settings-fields
                .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                  label([attr.for]='"api-source-" + profile.id') 密钥来源
                  select.form-control([id]='"api-source-" + profile.id', [ngModel]='keySource(profile)', (ngModelChange)='changeKeySource(profile, $event)')
                    option(value='direct') 直接输入
                    option(value='environment') 环境变量
                    option(value='vault') Tabby Vault
                .settings-field.settings-field-wide(*ngIf='keySource(profile) === "direct"')
                  label([attr.for]='"api-key-" + profile.id') API Key
                  input.form-control(type='password', [id]='"api-key-" + profile.id', [(ngModel)]='profile.apiKey', (ngModelChange)='modelConnectionChanged(profile)', autocomplete='off', spellcheck='false', [attr.aria-describedby]='"api-key-hint-" + profile.id')
                  small.settings-muted([id]='"api-key-hint-" + profile.id') 保存在本地 Tabby 插件配置中，无需启用 Vault。
                .settings-field.settings-field-wide(*ngIf='keySource(profile) === "environment"')
                  label([attr.for]='"api-env-" + profile.id') 环境变量名
                  input.form-control([id]='"api-env-" + profile.id', [(ngModel)]='profile.apiKeyEnv', (ngModelChange)='modelConnectionChanged(profile)')
                  small.settings-muted 使用 Tabby 进程继承的环境变量，修改变量后需要重启 Tabby。
                .settings-field.settings-field-wide(*ngIf='keySource(profile) === "vault"')
                  label([attr.for]='"api-vault-" + profile.id') 保存密钥到 Vault
                  .settings-input-action
                    input.form-control(type='password', [id]='"api-vault-" + profile.id', [(ngModel)]='keyDrafts[profile.id]', autocomplete='new-password')
                    button.btn.btn-outline-secondary(type='button', (click)='saveKey(profile)', [disabled]='savingKey || !keyDrafts[profile.id]') 保存密钥
                  small.settings-muted 先在 Tabby 中启用 Vault。密钥不写入普通插件配置；输入框不会回显已保存的密钥。
            .settings-advanced
              button.advanced-toggle(type='button', (click)='advancedOpen = !advancedOpen', [attr.aria-expanded]='advancedOpen', aria-controls='api-advanced-fields')
                span.advanced-chevron(aria-hidden='true') {{advancedOpen ? '−' : '+'}}
                span
                  strong 高级参数
                  small.settings-muted 思考模式、推理强度、上下文与工具限制
              #api-advanced-fields.settings-fields(*ngIf='advancedOpen')
                .settings-field
                  label([attr.for]='"api-thinking-" + profile.id') 思考模式
                  select.form-control([id]='"api-thinking-" + profile.id', [(ngModel)]='profile.thinking', (ngModelChange)='save()', [disabled]='profile.provider === "openai"')
                    option(value='default') 服务商默认
                    option(value='enabled') 开启
                    option(value='disabled') 关闭
                  small.settings-muted Claude 开启时使用 adaptive thinking；OpenAI 使用推理强度。
                .settings-field
                  label([attr.for]='"api-effort-" + profile.id') 推理强度（可选）
                  input.form-control([id]='"api-effort-" + profile.id', [(ngModel)]='profile.reasoningEffort', (ngModelChange)='save()', placeholder='服务商默认')
                  small.settings-muted 按模型文档填写原始值；留空不发送。
                .settings-field
                  label([attr.for]='"api-context-" + profile.id') 上下文窗口 tokens
                  input.form-control(type='number', [id]='"api-context-" + profile.id', min='0', [(ngModel)]='profile.contextWindow', (ngModelChange)='save()')
                  small.settings-muted 0 表示未知，用于显示使用占比，不代表账户额度。
                .settings-field
                  label([attr.for]='"api-output-" + profile.id') 单次最大输出 tokens
                  input.form-control(type='number', [id]='"api-output-" + profile.id', min='256', max='131072', [(ngModel)]='profile.maxOutputTokens', (ngModelChange)='save()')
                .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                  label([attr.for]='"api-iterations-" + profile.id') 每回合工具轮数上限
                  input.form-control(type='number', [id]='"api-iterations-" + profile.id', min='0', max='100', [(ngModel)]='profile.maxIterations', (ngModelChange)='save()')
                  small.settings-muted 0 表示不限固定轮数（默认）。1–100 限制工具调用轮数，另留收尾请求读取最后结果及更新目标；停止和目标 token 预算仍然生效。
            .settings-test
              .settings-test-actions
                button.btn.btn-outline-primary(type='button', (click)='testProfile(profile)', [disabled]='connectionTests[profile.id]?.running') {{connectionTests[profile.id]?.running ? '测试中…' : '测试连接'}}
                button.btn.btn-link(type='button', *ngIf='connectionTests[profile.id]?.running', (click)='cancelTest(profile)') 取消测试
                small.settings-muted 发送简短请求，产生少量 API 用量。
              p.field-notice(role='status', aria-live='polite', *ngIf='connectionTests[profile.id]') {{connectionTests[profile.id].notice}}
            .settings-remove
              button.btn.btn-outline-danger(type='button', (click)='removeProfile(profile)') 移除此连接
        ng-template(#codexSettings)
          .editor-heading
            span.provider-mark(aria-hidden='true') C
            .editor-identity
              .editor-eyebrow 当前配置 · 本机引擎
              h4 Codex
              .editor-model.settings-muted 使用本机 Codex CLI 登录
            span.default-badge(*ngIf='!settings.defaultProfileId') 默认连接
            button.btn.btn-outline-secondary.editor-default(type='button', *ngIf='settings.defaultProfileId', (click)='setDefault("")') 设为默认
          .editor-body
            section.settings-section(aria-labelledby='codex-engine-heading')
              h5#codex-engine-heading.section-heading
                span.section-dot(aria-hidden='true')
                | 本机引擎
              .settings-fields
                .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                  label(for='codex-executable') Codex CLI 可执行文件
                  input#codex-executable.form-control([(ngModel)]='settings.executable', (ngModelChange)='save()', placeholder='自动查找（codex）')
                  small.settings-muted 留空自动查找；也可填写完整路径或命令名，不附加参数。先运行 codex login 完成登录。
                  details.executable-help
                    summary.settings-muted 查看路径查找说明
                    p.settings-muted Linux/macOS 支持用户 Shell、NVM 和常见安装目录；Windows 支持 Codex 独立安装和桌面安装目录；也支持 CODEX_INSTALL_DIR、含空格路径和 ~/ 路径。显式路径无效会报错，自定义命令名仅查 PATH。设置键：codexAgent.executable。
                .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                  label(for='codex-cwd') 固定工作目录
                  input#codex-cwd.form-control([(ngModel)]='settings.cwd', (ngModelChange)='save()', placeholder='留空表示自动识别')
                  small.settings-muted 留空时使用当前本地终端的工作目录。
                .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                  label(for='codex-model') 模型
                  input#codex-model.form-control([(ngModel)]='settings.model', (ngModelChange)='save()', placeholder='Codex CLI 默认模型')
            section.settings-section(aria-labelledby='codex-permissions-heading')
              h5#codex-permissions-heading.section-heading
                span.section-dot(aria-hidden='true')
                | 权限与预算
              .settings-fields
                .settings-field
                  label(for='codex-approval') 审批策略
                  select#codex-approval.form-control([(ngModel)]='settings.approvalPolicy', (ngModelChange)='save()')
                    option(value='on-request') 按需询问
                    option(value='untrusted') 不可信命令询问
                    option(value='never') 不询问
                .settings-field
                  label(for='codex-sandbox') 沙箱
                  select#codex-sandbox.form-control([(ngModel)]='settings.sandbox', (ngModelChange)='save()')
                    option(value='workspace-write') 工作目录可写
                    option(value='read-only') 只读
                    option(value='danger-full-access') 完全访问
                .settings-field.settings-field-wide
                  label(for='codex-budget') 每个目标的 token 上限
                  input#codex-budget.form-control(type='number', min='0', [(ngModel)]='settings.goalTokenBudget', (ngModelChange)='save()')
                  small.settings-muted 0 表示不设置上限。达到上限会显示未完成状态。
  p.settings-footer.settings-muted 配置自动保存。修改连接参数后，在侧栏点击连接图标应用；切换连接保留当前对话，输入 /new 开始新对话。
